[profiles.guide]
notes = '''This is the gyro variant: tilting the controller moves the cursor, as a fine pointer next to the right stick {rs}. Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller.
The right stick {rs} moves the cursor: {rt} selects (left click, drag to box units), and {lt} gives the usual order for what's under it (right click: move, attack, assist, reclaim). The left stick {ls} pans the map, and {up} {down} zoom: zoom all the way out for the strategic view.
{south}, {west} and {north} order an attack, stop and patrol; for attack and patrol, click the target with {rt}. {left} orders a move and {right} assist (guard), also clicked with {rt}.
Hold {lb} for the control groups and aim the right stick {rs} at one: release to select it. Hold {lb} and {rb} together to put the selection in a group instead (Ctrl + number).
{rb} is Shift: hold it to queue orders and build orders, or add to the selection. Hold {l3} (Ctrl) while you click.
Click {r3} for the engineer and special orders (reclaim, repair, capture, ferry, dive, overcharge, self-destruct), aimed with the right stick {rs}. Build by clicking the construction menu at the bottom with {rt}.
{select} lists pause, chat and the menu. Hold {select} for the Menus mode (the lobby and the main menu) and hold it again to come back. {start} (Esc) is the menu, and {east} cancels an order or clears the selection.
The keys are the game's defaults as best remembered, not checked on an install: the order keys (A, S, P, M, G and the R3 orders), panning with the arrow keys and self-destruct (Ctrl + K) are the likeliest to differ. The game has no key settings: check the key bindings dialog (F1 in game) or your keymap file. Steam's game runs as SupremeCommander.exe, a name the original Supreme Commander shares, so the rule names its Steam folder; a GOG or disc install has another folder name, so pick the setup by hand there. ForgedAlliance.exe is Forged Alliance Forever's launcher-patched copy. Guide + {west} opens the on-screen keyboard for chat.'''

